          ↥(modularLocalizedAtPoint (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (redRestrict red K) (0 : k) ((0 : k) ^ q))), G'})
    (hnm2 : G' ∉ Ideal.span {(⟨modularEval (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (MvPolynomial.C ϖ),
